    "biography": "<p><strong>Type:</strong> Neogenetic</p><p><strong>Niche:</strong> Fortean, Oligarch Habitats</p><p><strong>Numbers:</strong> 1–3</p><p>The genehackers of Fortean recreated this mythological creature. It is an extremely large snake, equipped with a batch of tusk-like horns around its mouth. Some oligarchs and criminal groups now use them as guardians.</p><p><strong>Traits:</strong> Large Size (+10 to hit)</p><p><strong>Ware:</strong> Chameleon Skin, Enhanced Hearing, Enhanced Smell, Poison Gland (Twitch)</p><p><em>Initiative printed: 5 (X-Risks uses (INT + REF) ÷ 5); Wound Threshold 13, Death Rating 98.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase X-Risks, p. 158.</em></p>",
